WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:59.500
[Clear, shallow water at the edge of the Waikato River]

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:59.000
[Walking along a garden path with blossom and flowering trees]

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:59.000
[A sandy bank beside the river with geese standing at the water's edge]

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:58.500
[Looking across the Waikato River from the bank, with plants along the edge]

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:58.000
[Native bush and palms beside the path, then trees across the river]

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:26.600
[The Central City Jetty and its sign, looking out over the river]
